{"4598450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Forklift Basketball", "steam_appid": 4598450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4815520], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete against the best forklifters in the world to earn your forklift certification in Forklift Basketball!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forklift Basketball</strong> is a chaotic, physics-based sports party game that's as crazy as it sounds. Drive, lift, and (most importantly) dunk your way to victory in fast-paced matches with your friends (or enemies)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598450/extras/cf6e82215aaf2afd8e305ea1092e184a.poster.avif?t=1788005805\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598450/extras/cf6e82215aaf2afd8e305ea1092e184a.webm?t=1788005805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598450/extras/cf6e82215aaf2afd8e305ea1092e184a.mp4?t=1788005805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into <strong>online or local multiplayer</strong> with <strong>1v1 and 2v2 modes, </strong>with more modes to come before launch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598450/extras/7d063f11e3b89911568d133de4684f9d.poster.avif?t=1788005805\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598450/extras/7d063f11e3b89911568d133de4684f9d.webm?t=1788005805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598450/extras/7d063f11e3b89911568d133de4684f9d.mp4?t=1788005805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove you've got the skills to go toe-to-toe with the Forklifting world champions in the<strong> offline campaign mode!</strong> Play through a wide variety of themed arena locations and make it through the qualifiers to the knockout rounds to take home the title! Earn titles, new customisation options, and new maps to play on! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598450/extras/0222e544dcf6d3022ac75683b4a96e2c.poster.avif?t=1788005805\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598450/extras/0222e544dcf6d3022ac75683b4a96e2c.webm?t=1788005805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598450/extras/0222e544dcf6d3022ac75683b4a96e2c.mp4?t=1788005805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1v1 and 2v2 modes for competitive and casual play, with more to come!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer and local split-screen matches, as well as online leaderboards to scale!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player campaign with challenges, unlockables and progression!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pimp your 'llft with unlockable toppers, wheels, antennas, forks, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant replays and a theatre mode to relive your career highlights!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique arenas, play from the starting warehouse all the way to the stars and beyond!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598450/extras/b7bca696a375e09c7329b5d31a8988ab.poster.avif?t=1788005805\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598450/extras/b7bca696a375e09c7329b5d31a8988ab.webm?t=1788005805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598450/extras/b7bca696a375e09c7329b5d31a8988ab.mp4?t=1788005805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you on the court! And always remember the 5 D’s of Forklift Basketball: Dunk, dodge, dip, dive and dunk!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete against the best forklifters in the world to earn your forklift certification in Forklift Basketball!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forklift Basketball</strong> is a chaotic, physics-based sports party game that's as crazy as it sounds. Drive, lift, and (most importantly) dunk your way to victory in fast-paced matches with your friends (or enemies)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598450/extras/cf6e82215aaf2afd8e305ea1092e184a.poster.avif?t=1788005805\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598450/extras/cf6e82215aaf2afd8e305ea1092e184a.webm?t=1788005805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598450/extras/cf6e82215aaf2afd8e305ea1092e184a.mp4?t=1788005805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_parag