ompetitive and casual play, with more to come!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer and local split-screen matches, as well as online leaderboards to scale!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player campaign with challenges, unlockables and progression!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pimp your 'llft with unlockable toppers, wheels, antennas, forks, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant replays and a theatre mode to relive your career highlights!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique arenas, play from the starting warehouse all the way to the stars and beyond!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598450/extras/b7bca696a375e09c7329b5d31a8988ab.poster.avif?t=1788005805\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598450/extras/b7bca696a375e09c7329b5d31a8988ab.webm?t=1788005805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598450/extras/b7bca696a375e09c7329b5d31a8988ab.mp4?t=1788005805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you on the court! And always remember the 5 D’s of Forklift Basketball: Dunk, dodge, dip, dive and dunk!</p>", "short_description": "Compete against the world to earn your forklift certification in Forklift Basketball! Drive, lift, and dunk your way to victory in fast-paced matches filled with pure unpredictable fun!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Irish, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598450/fe4eb97fe2ce174179695338b53db9b7e73b3563/header.jpg?t=1788005805", "capsule_